# MongoDB Atlas Data API Credentials
#
# Steps to get these:
# 1. Go to https://cloud.mongodb.com → your project
# 2. Left sidebar → App Services → Create App ("urbanlifehomes-web")
# 3. HTTPS → Data API → Enable → select Cluster0 → Save & Deploy
# 4. Authentication → API Keys → Create Key ("website") → copy key
#
# Paste your values below:

ATLAS_DATA_API_URL=https://data.mongodb-api.com/app/YOUR_APP_ID/endpoint/data/v1
ATLAS_DATA_API_KEY=YOUR_API_KEY_HERE
ATLAS_DATA_SOURCE=Cluster0
MONGO_DB=urbanlifehomes
